78	/**
79	 * Human-readable "where did this come from" label. Many events have no
80	 * `author_name` (they weren't authored by a person — they're a watcher hit, a
81	 * scheduled digest, a notification, an action). Rather than print "Unknown",
82	 * fall back to the most specific source signal we have: the connector
83	 * (`platform` is the aliased connector_key), then a friendly origin_type. The
84	 * connector badge still renders separately, so this is the *actor*, not a
85	 * duplicate of the platform chip.
